# Bloodmoon "Establish the Mine": the player joins the East Empire Company
# under Carnius Magius at Fort Frostmoth, escorts Gidar, Gamin and Sabinus to
# the Raven Rock site, takes Falco's ebony and brings five pieces back. The
# escort is a real walk so the three miners follow the player there. The walk
# goes round the fort's west side: Skyrim's shortest path runs through the
# fort walls' load doors, where an AI-driven player stops. AddItem
# stands in for mining the other four pieces. Ref FormIDs carry Bloodmoon.esm's
# slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_bm_wildhunt
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case co_mine
run
player->PositionCell 3504 4553 16407 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 "Carnius Magius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Carnius Magius
ask East Empire Company
ask join the East Empire Company
choose 1
expect player->GetPCRank "East Empire Company" == 0
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_1 == 10
bye
run
player->Position -174437 138600 400 0
until 600 "Gidar Verothan"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Gidar Verothan
ask ready to go
choose 1
expect GetJournalIndex CO_1 == 20
bye
defend
walk -177800 139000 600
walk -178000 145500 900
walk -197322 160100 870
until 600 GetJournalIndex CO_1 == 30
bye
talk Falco Galenus
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_1 == 40
expect player->GetItemCount ingred_raw_ebony_01 == 1
bye
run
player->AddItem ingred_raw_ebony_01 4
player->PositionCell 3504 4553 16407 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 "Carnius Magius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Carnius Magius
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_1 == 50
expect player->GetItemCount ingred_raw_ebony_01 == 0
bye
end
